{"publicId":"185008bf-9717-400d-9f41-e90a19472c58","title":"Linux 6.5安全修复导致IPv6路由查找性能下降20周期","status":"watching","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-11T08:25:31.231Z","latestAt":"2026-11-11T08:25:31.231Z","digest":"作者在AMD EPYC 8024P和Zen 4c CPU上测试发现，Linux 6.5版本引入的SRSO安全修复使IPv6路由查找性能下降约20时钟周期（较IPv4的4周期影响更显著），主要因IPv6查找涉及25次函数调用而IPv4仅4次。性能下降源于安全修复调整了条件判断顺序，导致常驻链路状态无需调用ip_ignore_linkdown()的优化失效。此结论基于对2.6.32至7.3内核的持续跟踪测试，其中6.5版本后IPv6性能波动与SRSO修复直接相关。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-11T08:43:05.452Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"Linux内核路由查找性能演变与安全修复影响分析","latestReport":{"id":"v4pib2v3hlfhyr5jngl71w9ft"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fnXkaHp6UNE0","title":"Linux IPv4和IPv6路由查找性能改进","firstReportAt":"2026-11-11T08:25:31.231Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"v4pib2v3hlfhyr5jngl71w9ft","title":"Linux内核路由查找性能演变与安全修复影响分析","summary":"作者在AMD EPYC 8024P和Zen 4c CPU上测试了Linux 2.6.32至7.3内核的路由查找性能，发现6.5版本引入的SRSO安全修复导致IPv6性能下降约20 cycles，而IPv4性能受影响较小（约4 cycles）。","source":{"name":"Lobsters 热榜","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T08:25:31.231Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"v4pib2v3hlfhyr5jngl71w9ft","title":"Linux内核路由查找性能演变与安全修复影响分析","summary":"作者在AMD EPYC 8024P和Zen 4c CPU上测试了Linux 2.6.32至7.3内核的路由查找性能，发现6.5版本引入的SRSO安全修复导致IPv6性能下降约20 cycles，而IPv4性能受影响较小（约4 cycles）。","source":{"name":"Lobsters 热榜","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T08:25:31.231Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-11T09:00:00.000Z","heat":9.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T10:00:00.000Z","heat":9.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T12:00:00.000Z","heat":9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T15:00:00.000Z","heat":8.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T18:00:00.000Z","heat":7.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T21:00:00.000Z","heat":7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T22:00:00.000Z","heat":6.8,"particip